# Deploy driver for the dev box. Deliberately untracked: it is placed on the box
# by hand and lives only there. cd-dev.yml invokes it over SSM Run Command and
# checks it exists first, so a missing copy fails with a named error.
#
# TRADE-OFF: it is not reviewed or versioned, and `git reset --hard` in the
# deploy leaves it alone (as it does .env and ecosystem.config.js), so the box's
# copy is authoritative. Any change has to be copied across manually, and a box
# rebuild needs it restored — keep a copy somewhere durable.
tools/deploy-dev.sh
.worktrees/
